eer to transport you magically through the air to visit it.", "short_description": "Come and visit this little Advent Calendar in Virtual Reality.\nTake a tour in Santa's Sleigh around the 24 doors, and enjoy the Christmas sights and sounds.\n\nThe controls are simple. You just need to find the next door and look at it for Rudolph and the other reindeer to transport you magically through the air to visit it."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vradventcalendar.thefusionworks.com/Privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lindsay Manning", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vradventcalendar.thefusionworks.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8560834910700745"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_1612553736023810_1470860650644466565_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TGlMjXNmufIQ7kNvwH78PZZ&_nc_oc=AdqQwyNAuRLf1CSAcpEapZuyRS9IOlebANt8WLyYEszjKsDvTG0aW9q6htp6dDLREwo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1iyKFGpriWdKGyCBI6Qsv_MNE3d5lYMHC_jaRDZIAQTw&oe=69EB8923"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Chr